## Cross-cutting rules

- Branching: `dev/{developer}/{version}/{type}/{ado-id}-{slug}` → versioned `team/*` →
  versioned `release/*`. The work item id is the **last segment** of a dev branch and is the
  only part anything parses. Every `dev/*` PR links exactly one work item: the lowest-level one.
